  "description": "Welcome to Calculated Lag !!\n\n&quot;We aren&#039;t freezing; we’re just bufferring our greatness.&quot;\n\n​We believe in strategic inactivity and maximum rewards. If you prefer your progress automated and your stress levels low, you’re home.\n\n​The Terms &amp; Conditions:\n​Combat Level: 50+ (Show us you’ve at least pressed a button once).\n\n​Dailies: Contribute to guild challenges. Help us help you.\n\n​Attendance: Life happens, but don&#039;t go MIA for 2+ days without a heads-up.\n\n​Vibe Check: Be chill. We’re here to idle, not to argue.\n\n​Move slow. Loot fast. Lag intentionally.",
